\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"selfReview\":{\"passesRun\":1,\"findingsFixed\":[\"Replaced legacy ownership-dependent current-material role labeling with version-provenance-based labeling so real Convex artifact summaries no longer misclassify referenced artifacts.\",\"Expanded review target and artifact review eligibility to include current refs without regressing existing produced-artifact and package-snapshot review behavior.\",\"Caught and fixed the temporary integration regression caused by an overly narrow current-ref-only reviewability rule before final gate verification.\"],\"findingsSurfaced\":[]},\"openQuestions\":[],\"specDeviations\":[],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"Move to verification with focused checks on cross-process artifact reference behavior across the project shell, process materials, and review entry paths.\"}\napps/platform/shared/contracts/process-work-surface.ts:307:export type ProcessArtifactReference = z.infer<typeof processArtifactReferenceSchema>;\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/01-project-artifact-association-without-process-ownership/001-implementor.json:1:{\"command\":\"story-implement\",\"version\":1,\"status\":\"ok\",\"outcome\":\"ready-for-verification\",\"result\":{\"resultId\":\"1d988d04-a927-4814-86db-bf2c38c5d5c6\",\"provider\":\"codex\",\"model\":\"gpt-5.4\",\"role\":\"story_implementor\",\"sessionId\":\"019dcbbf-d80e-7771-a6db-1dfeec7bef8d\",\"continuation\":{\"provider\":\"codex\",\"sessionId\":\"019dcbbf-d80e-7771-a6db-1dfeec7bef8d\",\"storyId\":\"01-project-artifact-association-without-process-ownership\"},\"outcome\":\"ready-for-verification\",\"story\":{\"id\":\"01-project-artifact-association-without-process-ownership\",\"title\":\"Story 1: Project Artifact Association Without Process Ownership\"},\"planSummary\":\"Updated the project-shell/process-surface read paths so current process artifact visibility and reviewability can come from current refs instead of legacy single-process ownership hints, while preserving existing produced-artifact/package review behavior. Added story-level server coverage for stripped shell summaries, referenced-artifact materials, and cross-process referenced review access.\",\"changedFiles\":[{\"path\":\"apps/platform/server/services/processes/readers/materials-section.reader.ts\",\"reason\":\"Derive process artifact role labels from artifact version provenance instead of legacy artifact ownership fields.\"},{\"path\":\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts\",\"reason\":\"Union current refs with produced artifacts when building review targets so cross-process references work without regressing existing review/package flows.\"},{\"path\":\"apps/platform/server/services/review/artifact-review.service.ts\",\"reason\":\"Allow artifact review when the process currently references the artifact, while preserving existing produced-artifact review access.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/server/project-shell-bootstrap-api.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added coverage that project-shell artifact summaries strip legacy process ownership fields from API output.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/server/process-work-surface-api.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added coverage for referenced-artifact materials labeling and review availability from current refs.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/server/artifact-review-api.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added coverage for reviewing an artifact referenced by a later process but produced by an earlier one.\"}],\"tests\":{\"added\":[],\"modified\":[\"tests/service/server/project-shell-bootstrap-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/process-work-surface-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/artifact-review-api.test.ts\"],\"removed\":[],\"totalAfterStory\":556,\"deltaFromPriorBaseline\":3},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm exec vitest run tests/service/server/project-shell-bootstrap-api.test.t