ice/client/artifact-review-panel.test.ts\\\",\\\"tests/service/client/artifact-section.test.ts\\\",\\\"tests/integration/platform-shell.test.ts\\\"],\\\"removed\\\":[],\\\"totalAfterStory\\\":552,\\\"deltaFromPriorBaseline\\\":1},\\\"gatesRun\\\":[{\\\"command\\\":\\\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"pass\\\"},{\\\"command\\\":\\\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"pass\\\"}],\\\"selfReview\\\":{\\\"passesRun\\\":0,\\\"findingsFixed\\\":[\\\"Removed artifact ownership fields from project-shell artifact summaries/rendering while preserving process-local artifact references.\\\",\\\"Added provenance ids/display labels to review version contracts and patched store/service/test scaffolding to emit them consistently.\\\",\\\"Added durable process package-context tables plus store methods with canonical upsert/idempotent semantics.\\\",\\\"Fixed the production-shell integration assertion to resolve the built asset from the active worktree instead of a hard-coded sibling checkout path.\\\"],\\\"findingsSurfaced\\\":[]},\\\"openQuestions\\\":[],\\\"specDeviations\\\":[\\\"Browser-facing package member contracts still expose legacy `versionId`; Story 0 added the durable/package-context `artifactVersionId` vocabulary and deferred the surface rename to avoid wider Story 3/4 regressions.\\\",\\\"Review target schemas still accept legacy `REVIEW_MEMBER_UNAVAILABLE` alongside `PACKAGE_MEMBER_UNAVAILABLE` as a compatibility bridge for existing package review flows.\\\"],\\\"recommendedNextStep\\\":\\\"Implement Story 1 against the new project-scoped artifact summary and package-context foundation.\\\"},\\\"errors\\\":[],\\\"warnings\\\":[],\\\"artifacts\\\":[{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"result-envelope\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build-wt-1/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/00-foundation/001-implementor.json\\\"}],\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-04-26T20:48:50.222Z\\\",\\\"finishedAt\\\