tifact versions and package members, and refreshing fixtures/tests so the foundation vocabulary now matches the story and DoD.\\\",\\\"changedFiles\\\":[{\\\"path\\\":\\\"apps/platform/shared/contracts/review-workspace.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Replaced package-member `versionId` with `artifactVersionId` and removed the legacy `REVIEW_MEMBER_UNAVAILABLE` review-target error code alias.\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"apps/platform/shared/contracts/schemas.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Kept the Story 0 request-level error code set aligned with the route-level taxonomy.\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"apps/platform/server/errors/codes.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Provides the exact Story 0 route-level error code constants used by review services and routes.\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"apps/platform/server/services/review/artifact-review.service.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Explicit missing artifact versions now throw `ARTIFACT_VERSION_NOT_FOUND` instead of collapsing to a generic missing target.\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"apps/platform/server/services/review/package-review.service.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Updated package-member review handling to use the `artifactVersionId` vocabulary and `PACKAGE_MEMBER_UNAVAILABLE` error code.\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"apps/platform/server/services/review/review-workspace.service.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Workspace bootstrap now preserves bounded unavailable artifact state with the exact Story 0 error code when explicit version selection fails.\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"apps/platform/server/routes/review.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Direct artifact/package review routes now distinguish exact Story 0 error codes for explicit missing version/member cases and support 409 taxonomy responses.\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"apps/platform/server/schemas/review.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Expanded review route schemas so exact 409 request-error responses are valid at the route boundary.\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Update