pectations to assert bounded `ARTIFACT_VERSION_NOT_FOUND` degradation instead of a generic missing target.\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"tests/service/server/package-review-api.test.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Updated package-member vocabulary expectations to `artifactVersionId` and direct-route 404 taxonomy for explicit missing/unavailable members.\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"tests/service/server/review-export-api.test.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Updated package fixtures to the renamed package-member vocabulary.\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"tests/service/server/nfr.test.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Updated NFR package fixtures to use `artifactVersionId`.\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"tests/service/server/observability.test.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Updated observability package fixtures to use `artifactVersionId`.\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"tests/service/client/package-member-nav.test.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Updated client package-member fixtures and selected artifact expectations to the renamed vocabulary.\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"tests/service/client/package-review-panel.test.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Updated client package-review fixtures to the renamed package-member vocabulary.\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"tests/service/client/a11y.test.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Updated a11y package-member fixtures to the renamed vocabulary.\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"tests/integration/review-workspace.test.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Updated integration review-package expectations to `artifactVersionId` and `PACKAGE_MEMBER_UNAVAILABLE` taxonomy.\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"tests/integration/platform-shell.test.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Retains the worktree-safe production shell asset assertion needed for passing the integration gate.\\\"}],\\\"tests\\\":{\\\"added\\\":[],\\\"modified\\\":[\\\"tests/service/server/review-foundation-contracts.test.ts\\\",\\\"tests/service/server/artifact-review-api.test.ts\\\",\\\"tests/service/server/review-workspace-api.test.ts\\\",\\\"tests/service/server/package-review-api.test.ts\\\",\\\"tes